{"seq":13,"at":"2026-11-06T11:40:06.182Z","type":"report.text","job":"A","data":{"step":"search-1","provider":"search","text":"Cold-chain spoilage for regional grocers usually comes down to three levers: monitoring (sensors and data loggers that flag temperature excursions), equipment and infrastructure (refrigeration upgrades, backup power, insulated or reefer transport), and process or operational controls (receiving checks, rotation, shelf-life and display practices). Compare them on capital cost, payback period, and how much spoilage each actually prevents, and be wary of vendor-supplied figures, since I can't verify current numbers here. Check whether the evidence comes from grocers of similar size and climate, not only from large national chains."},"prev":"a0f1022154b9b531c9699f2c9383e5ab7f84f2c84b1b8be22c014b328b40b117","hash":"cab9ab6ff61e144d48144d67f688e75ad8bed52036935e8a90fb8e031264c226"}
{"seq":14,"at":"2026-11-06T11:40:29.536Z","type":"payment","job":"A","data":{"provider":"lookup","step":"lookup-1","price":"0.030000","spent":"0.050000","status":200,"tries":4,"ms":23352,"invoice":"0x81eb5ef756b0e9f35b30766d1848ed0e3a0eb2757385424baf87063c577df4cb:3decd0ca-4fef-4eb0-bca3-92430a4a9bd7"},"prev":"cab9ab6ff61e144d48144d67f688e75ad8bed52036935e8a90fb8e031264c226","hash":"cac0b0c61ca32b8d5ab58af4fdd5d5bb386a7a11e6d021deef8c2cde9ad752f2"}
{"seq":15,"at":"2026-11-06T11:40:29.537Z","type":"report.text","job":"A","data":{"step":"lookup-1","provider":"lookup","text":"Background notes: The three approaches are not named in your request, so confirm which ones you mean (for example, sensor-based monitoring, refrigeration upgrades, or route and inventory optimization) before comparing them. Any spoilage figures should be checked against each grocer's own shrink records, since I have no access to lookup data and cannot supply retrieved numbers. Before relying on comparisons, verify that cost and savings estimates use the same time period, store scale, and definition of spoilage."},"prev":"cac0b0c61ca32b8d5ab58af4fdd5d5bb386a7a11e6d021deef8c2cde9ad752f2","hash":"69eb54bce8bb2c83b13cdd989fb61c07e5a7fa53f45039954a83e0f6006fbd6a"}
